WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
One picture. A Repair Café.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.650
A man repairs a bike.

3
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.550
A woman sews a jacket.

4
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:08.470
On the wall, a sign:

5
00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:11.620
«Ne jetez plus, réparez
!» Above the picture,

6
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:14.080
a label: «Partage de la planète».

7
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.150
15 minutes to prepare.

8
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.810
Notes: 10 bullet points at most.

9
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.730
No script. Then you
talk for 3 to 4 minutes.

10
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.450
The teacher listens.

11
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.330
So how do you turn one picture into four

12
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.240
minutes of real French?

13
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.440
In this mission, you'll see
the whole oral on a timeline,

14
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.770
part by part.

15
00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:36.810
Then you'll hear a model
talk on this very picture,

16
00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.890
built up step by step.

17
00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:42.070
Your mission: work out what
to say about a picture,

18
00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.230
and in what order.
